Brio-Wu MHD shock tube problem rotated around Z axis
! Param/SHOCKTUBE/briowu spliced in so this deck is self-contained
#GAMMA
2.0			Gamma

#SHOCKTUBE
1.000000000000001			LeftState Rho
0.			LeftState Ux
0.			LeftState Uy
0.			LeftState Uz
0.75			LeftState Bx
1.			LeftState By
0.			LeftState Bz
1.			LeftState p
0.125			RightState Rho
0.			RightState Ux
0.			RightState Uy
0.			RightState Uz
0.75			RightState Bx
-1.			RightState By
0.			RightState Bz
0.1			RightState p

#SHOCKPOSITION
0.0		ShockPosition
0.5		ShockSlope

Sheared boundary condition is used for non-zero shock slope
#OUTERBOUNDARY
shear		xMinBc
shear		xMaxBc
shear		yMinBc
shear		yMaxBc
float		zMinBc
float		zMaxBc

#TIMESTEPPING
2		nStage
0.8		CflExpl

#SCHEME
2		nOrder
Roe		TypeFlux
mc3		TypeLimiter
1.5		LimiterBeta

#SAVELOGFILE
